o has been enhanced with additional content.Two more levelsTwo new levels to put you to the test, introducing a formidable new enemy: the Crossbowman. This cunning enemy is determined to take down your heroes! Try to outsmart him by setting traps ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:42:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692476","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4605410-1844751498222024","game_id":"steam-4605410","kind":"announcement","title":"Sanctuaries demo now on Steam","summary":"Hi everyone,Great news today! The demo for our better, shinier PC version of Sanctuaries finally reached the friendly shores of Steam!The game benefits from numerous improvements all over the place, and we are very proud of this one, our finest game to date!What's in it?The additions and changes in the PC version, compared to the free-to-play mobile one, were already covered in a previous article so no need to dwell on it.Here is a simple summary for the executives in the crowd:Re-vamped game in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T16:09:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222024","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:13:17Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4605410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:41Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:41Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4605410":"2026-10-26T12:55:41Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4605410":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:41Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:41Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:41Z"},"5268970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:55:41Z","l